# m2_play: the preview GIF script. A on the title at 30, hold still and fire through the
# opening gnat strings (60-239), then sweep up 40 / hold 20 / down 40 / hold 20 to 3960.
# Since M5 there is no bomb; two short hold-B rewinds:
# - B 2084..2093 (10 frames = 20 ticks): game tick 2053 -> 2033, fuel 180 -> 160. The
#   inputs keep their update indices, so after the release the sweep runs 30 ticks ahead of
#   the world (10 frames not simulated + 20 ticks undone).
# - B 3320..3334 (15 frames = 30 ticks), since the catch-up clock in the stage-1 boss fight:
#   game tick 3258 -> 3228, fuel 180 -> 150 (the refill had topped it up again).
# The press frame is already MANUAL (state 5); the release frame is PLAYING without a tick.
# Since M7 (Bullet hell for real) the sweep cannot live through stage 1 any more: in a normal
# game it spends its three rewinds and dies. So it plays in the endless probe mode
# (debug_probe at 31: a hit is counted in debug_hits and charges the power loss, a level and a
# fork, plus 80 mercy, at once; no rewind, the game goes on), and the old "survives with all
# three rewinds" pin becomes M7's acceptance bound for the sweep in stage 1: at least 6 hits
# (PLAN.md M7 "Difficulty targets"; 14 when re-pinned for the catch-up clock).
# Re-pinned for the catch-up table clock (a thin field runs the stage table faster): the
# waves come sooner, so every crate moved earlier and stage 1's table ends inside the run
# (WARNING at 2883, the boss at 3063: phase 2 at the end, until then 0). Crates on the way:
# F2 at 780, the hit at 1128 takes it back (F1, mercy 213), fork 1 at 1345 (lost to the hit
# at 1378), the A crate at 1619 swaps F1 for A1 (11), the retry shield at 1650 absorbs the
# hit at 1705 (shield 0, hits still 6). Identity 0 on every frame from 31 when written.
--frames 4000 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_score,debug_hits,debug_fuel,debug_grazes,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_phase --expect "debug_score > 570" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_hits >= 6" --expect "debug_phase == 2" --at "779 debug_weapon == 1" --at "780 debug_weapon == 2" --at "1127 debug_hits == 2" --at "1128 debug_hits == 3" --at "1128 debug_weapon == 1" --at "1128 debug_mercy == 213" --at "1345 debug_forks == 1" --at "1619 debug_weapon == 11" --at "1650 debug_shield == 1" --at "1704 debug_shield == 1" --at "1705 debug_shield == 0" --at "1705 debug_hits == 6" --at "2083 debug_state == 1" --at "2084 debug_state == 5" --at "2093 debug_fuel == 160" --at "2094 debug_state == 1" --at "2094 debug_game_tick == 2033" --at "2882 debug_phase == 0" --at "2883 debug_phase == 1" --at "3063 debug_phase == 2" --at "3320 debug_state == 5" --at "3334 debug_game_tick == 3228" --at "3335 debug_state == 1" --at "3335 debug_fuel == 150" --at "1500 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2090 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3999 debug_history_check == 0"
